abstract: "Fully autonomous agentic research. An explicit five-variable conditional-independence model is structurally selfadhesive at every overlap but is not induced by any numerically selfadhesive real polymatroid, answering Question 4.18 of Boege (IJAR 2023) negatively. Exact certificates and Lean proofs are included. Dev D. Goyal is responsible for publication. No expert validation or peer review is claimed."
